OL,3,GNEWSAMinister planning post-prison
OL,4,Asupervision scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey's justice minister is due to
OL,7,Fbring a draft law to the States to make
OL,8,Fit a legal requirement for prisoners to
OL,9,Fengage with probation after release,
OL,10,Fshe says.
OL,12,FHelen Miles said a draft would be
OL,13,Fbrought to the assembly in the first
OL,14,Fhalf of 2027.
OL,16,FJersey is the only place in the British
OL,17,FIsles that does not have post custodial
OL,18,Fsupervision legislation. In England and
OL,19,FWales, it is a legal requirement for
OL,20,Foffenders to engage with probation, but
OL,21,Fthis happens on a voluntary basis in
OL,22,FJersey.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
