OL,3,GNEWSAMinister planning post-prison
OL,4,Asupervision scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Probation Service it recognised the
OL,7,Fpotential to improve outcomes but added
OL,8,Fstaff were concerned about unintended
OL,9,Fconsequences, including unnecessary
OL,10,Fprison recalls "for relatively minor
OL,11,Fbreaches".
